  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">civic education pre-study</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">folkbildning f&#xf6;rstudie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folkbildningsr&#xe5;det kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie om folkbildnings organisationer i de baltiska staterna och Polen. F&#xf6;rstudien kommer attvara en viktigt verktyg f&#xf6;r fortsatta strategier f&#xf6;r att arbeta med demokratifr&#xe5;gor och vuxenutbildning i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish non governmental organisation, Folkbildningsr&#xe5;det will be responsible for a survey on adult education organisations which works with civic education and democracy in the Baltic States and Poland. The survey would provide guidlines and a strategy for future work with increasing awareness about democratic processes.</narrative>
  </description>
